ongping at the age of thirty-four, and Liu Bian succeeded him.","jp":"東漢末期の皇帝。漢の少帝劉弁、献帝劉協の父。在位中は荒淫無道で官爵を売りさばき、天下の大乱を招いて東漢の滅亡を早めた。中平六年に病没、終年三十四歳。劉弁が帝位を継いだ。","kr":"동한 말년의 황제이자 한 소제 유변, 한 헌제 유협의 부친이다. 재위 기간 황음무도하고 매관매직을 일삼아 천하의 대란을 초래하였으며 동한의 멸망을 앞당겼다. 중평 6년에 병사하니 향년 34세였으며, 유변이 뒤를 이었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10073","remark":"","surname":"汉","surnameTc":"漢","surnameEn":"Han","surnameJp":"漢","surnameKr":"한","surnameOther":"","name":"灵帝","nameTc":"靈帝","nameEn":"Emperor Ling","nameJp":"霊帝","nameKr":"영제","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"汉灵帝","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"1","recruit":"0","travel":"0","state":"3","workYear":"184","city":"CS1026","gender":"0","rule":"26","force":"26","wise":"32","politics":"30","charm":"75","will":"65","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"1","wiseTalent":"1","politicsTalent":"1","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"8/8/51/8/8/8/50/8","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"600","battleSoulPoint":"600","debateSoulPoint":"100","strategy":"1010615","strategy2":"1005301;1005801","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/2/0/2/2/1/0/3/0/1/1/1/1/2/0/4/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"0","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","evaluate":"-5000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"156","show":"184","death":"189","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"4","weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1018205","helmet":"WP1025905","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"2/1;3/2;5/3;0/1;8/1;28/3;46/3;6/3;16/2;22/3;19/0;13/0","father":"","mother":"WJ1015715/0","children":"WJ1026815/100;W